{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年45歲的陳自瑤（Yoyo）近年獲無綫電視（TVB）安排擔正劇集女主角，同時轉戰內地市場發展直播帶貨並屢創佳績。適逢中秋佳節，陳自瑤穿上中式旗袍，留言祝賀網民「人月兩團圓」。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤近年狀態大勇。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180166185757446144436510.jpeg/yMPLBQOuXv_jXF8is-z3Q0DS0cEnDpKK7evUQO3r1EA\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤近年狀態大勇。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>陳自瑤換上典雅旗袍賀中秋</p><p>為配合中秋節氛圍，陳自瑤穿上修身剪裁中式旗袍拍下美照，展現身材線條與古典氣質。陳自瑤在帖文中寫道：「中秋節，當然要穿旗袍應節啦。祝大家月餅節快樂，人月兩團圓！事事圓滿！loveyo。中秋節快樂。旗袍yo」，向大家送上節日祝福。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤身材出眾。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180167309827117056173905.jpeg/ozqO8trT2m0fAl7RXgfSohlHWssccCMACKUf-wilH_s\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤身材出眾。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤十分應節地著上旗袍。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180167307746611200034157.jpeg/puU3u2qBFuR8jRwcQUu0ixhrYrfW5QSm6pjKYOqYymA\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤十分應節地著上旗袍。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"修身旗袍完美展現了陳自瑤傲人的身材線條。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180167511224619008150732.jpeg/WC5g0OR3WKJlYmpN0J6W8NQdF87Q5UV8BDcIEQQ3CBE\"/><figcaption>修身旗袍完美展現了陳自瑤傲人的身材線條。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"簡直是「無死角女神」！（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180167303325552640203587.jpeg/eg8Z2TpOQfpEY0YAmv7HjjCo6QM9xnEK0a6LdNGui3Q\"/><figcaption>簡直是「無死角女神」！（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魅力不減！（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180166623449845760294301.jpeg/m2swL-tQyY7jFnu8qHD30iF12Kckc-ox42_tg-Nv7YM\"/><figcaption>魅力不減！（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T11:19:18.926986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}